cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite this repository, please cite the version you used and include its
  release DOI when one is available.
title: "Research Artifact Ledger"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Richard George
date-released: 2026-10-08
version: 0.2.0
url: https://github.com/RichardGeorgeDavis/research-artifact-ledger
abstract: >-
  A versioned repository for bounded research artifacts with explicit source
  trails, evidence labels, reproduction notes, limitations, and correction
  history. Version 0.2.0 includes a reproduced finite negative prime-ranking
  screen; no general predictor or novelty claim is made. Untagged additions on main
  include a philosophical working paper with scoped source review, synthetic
  demonstrations and unresolved evidential questions, and an exploratory note on
  numerical cognition and cognitive command, updated on main to a revised author
  version submitted by email (submission does not establish acceptance or peer review),
  with scoped source review and open questions; cite a commit when using main.
